  missionName: Solar Orbit Expedition
  targetDestination: Sun (Observation Orbit)
  estimatedDuration: 180 Days
  description: Navigate a specialized heat-shielded spacecraft to a safe perihelion observation orbit. Collect heliophysics data, observe coronal mass ejections, and return safely to Earth. NEVER attempt to land on the Sun.
